# Milestone: v0.10.2-reactive (W1)
# Covers: OP_CLOSURE inside at (e?) body resolves nested closure protos.
#         Reactive audit F4 (watcher-body variant).
#
# Activated 2026-05-25 (W1): body strand root_proto fixed in
# do_spawn_body_coroutine (uwatcher_spawn.c).  Prior to the fix, the watcher
# body strand had root_proto == NULL so OP_CLOSURE at frame_count==0 halted
# with "CLOSURE: proto index out of range".
#
# Semantics: at (e?) is a one-shot AT_EVENT subscriber.  One emit drives
# one body-strand execution.  The body creates a function literal (OP_CLOSURE)
# and calls it; the result is accumulated in Realm.tick_count.
# Expected: inner(10) = 11; tick_count == 11 after one emit.

Realm.tick_count = 0
var e = Event.new()
at (e?) { var inner = function (x) { x + 1 } | Realm.tick_count = Realm.tick_count + inner(10) }
e!
Realm.tick_count
[00000000] 0
[00000000] <event>
[00000000] nil
[00000001] nil
[00000001] 11
